{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "id": "shingled",
  "name": {
    "en": "Shingled (overlapping cells, bifacial N-type TOPCon matrix)",
    "es": "Celdas tejadas / shingled (solapadas, TOPCon tipo N bifacial)"
  },
  "kind": "technology",
  "description": {
    "en": "Cells cut into strips and laid in overlapping rows with conductive adhesive (matrix layout) instead of busbar ribbons, which raises active area. Reference: Heckert APOLLON 2.0 (390 shingle cells, 1762 x 1134 x 30 mm, bifacial N-type TOPCon, preliminary datasheet 03/2026). The TCL MI590 page remains mostly unreadable; it is kept only for the cell-layout and standards lines.",
    "es": "Celdas cortadas en tiras y dispuestas en filas solapadas con adhesivo conductor (disposicion matricial) en lugar de cintas de barra, lo que aumenta el area activa. Referencia: Heckert APOLLON 2.0 (390 celdas shingle, 1762 x 1134 x 30 mm, TOPCon tipo N bifacial, ficha preliminar 03/2026). La ficha TCL MI590 sigue casi ilegible; solo se usa para la disposicion de celdas y las normas."
  },
  "typical_use": "High-density bifacial modules with reduced cell-gap and shading losses; reference is a 450-460 Wp module.",
